    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_0c7b43ae",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Mysogynous; overall-intent-description: The image features a Black man in a luxurious fur coat and hat, posing confidently. The text reads: 'shoutout to all the ladies who don't gotta be half naked to get a mans attention. the rest of you bitches come with me.' The overall intent is to objectify women by implying that only those who are sexually provocative (\"half naked\") receive attention, while dismissing other women as unworthy. The use of the term \"bitches\" is derogatory and degrading toward women. This meme is misogynistic as it reduces women to their sexual availability and reinforces harmful stereotypes about female behavior and value. The juxtaposition of the man's confident, wealthy appearance with the demeaning text about women's worth creates a message that devalues women's autonomy and dignity. The meme promotes a harmful and sexist worldview that equates a woman's worth with her sexual appeal.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_8f19797e"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
