      "instance_name": "man",
      "label": "Black man",
      "description": "A Black man is centrally positioned in the image, posing confidently with his head tilted slightly upward. He is wearing a white fedora-style hat and a luxurious, oversized fur coat with a prominent collar, over a white collared shirt. His expression is smug and self-assured, with a slight smirk. His hands are placed on his chest and abdomen, with one hand showing a ring. The background is plain white, emphasizing his figure and attire. His appearance suggests wealth and confidence, contrasting with the misogynistic text overlay.",
