      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The man is mapped as the speaker of the text",
      "description": "The text 'shoutout to all the ladies who don't gotta be half naked to get a mans attention. the rest of you bitches come with me' is attributed to the man in the image. His confident, wealthy appearance and smug expression are used to visually represent the persona of the speaker who is making this misogynistic statement. The visual material (the man) is mapped onto the textual material (the speaker of the text).",
